Z||000002||Monkeyman||08-04-2000||02:14 AM||||Although I'm not a fan of a T handle shifter (mine's a Camaro unit), I definitely like the boot.  It really does look like it came that way from the factory.  Good find.||||reg||1
Z||000003||My7Fieros||08-04-2000||02:25 AM||||For some strange reason Ive always LOVED the T handle....looks cool and just feels right in your hand. However, I really like that G/A one you put on....looks like a modernized version! Sweet...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
